  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIDA Experts Placement &#x2013; Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to contribute to the Youth Employment Project for Somalia by strengthening the institutional development of Somalia. This will be done through the enhancement of development plans for industries that create employment opportunities and a human resource development plan toward advancing youth employment in Somalia. To do so, public sector institutions selected throughout the previous phase &#x2013; as well as a newly identified one &#x2013; will be supported and strengthened by diaspora experts. This approach will guarantee continuity to the intervention proposed by the previous phase of the project, thus allowing diaspora experts and local institutions to keep cooperating by building on the previous results achieved and, therefore, setting new strategic milestones to reach. At the same time, the scope of the intervention proposed will be further expanded by engaging a new institution.</narrative>
  </description>
